<title>NETHERLANDS: MeesPierson maintains DSM as &quot;Buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>MeesPierson maintains DSM as &quot;Buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Feb research note.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    DSM		 Chemicals     175.30  Mees Pierson</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (unchanged). Still positive on stock despite lower than expected Q4 results. Recent 10 pct drop in oil prices will widen margins in 1997 Q1 more than previously anticipated. Margin improvement will add 30 million guilders more to bottom line in Q1, dividend increase very likely as DSM compares its policy with European peers. Price target 230 guilders on 12-months horizon.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1996		   23.20    25.00		  9.00</p>
<p>    1997		   32.50    32.50    5.2	10.00</p>
<p>    1998		   29.00    29.00    5.8	10.00</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
